<title>NETHERLANDS: Delta Lloyd cuts Dutch PTT to hold.</title>
<headline>Delta Lloyd cuts Dutch PTT to hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Aug 28 research.</p>
<p>Company----------------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Dutch PTT		  59.10   Delta Lloyd Bank</p>
<p>COMMENT: &quot;KPN shows a solid balance sheet but with net profit estimated to grow a steady 8-10 pct annually over the next few years, we do not expect KPN to outperform the Dutch market.&quot; Analyst Peter Wortel says cutting to hold from buy.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	4.89     12.0    2.60</p>
<p>    1996		   5.35     11.0    2.85</p>
<p>    1997		   5.85     10.0    3.05</p>
